<title>UK: RATP sets 100 million Sfr bond due 2002.</title>
<headline>RATP sets 100 million Sfr bond due 2002.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   REGIE AUTONOME DES TRANSPORTS PARISIENS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.0	 MATURITY    25.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.55    PAY DATE    25.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   11.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/=     DENOMS (K) 5	   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
